> Hi Mark. For me to attend the cabin weekend, I need the following arrangements confirmed in advance:
>
> - a private bedroom that no one enters without my express permission;
> - no one-on-one rides, activities, or task assignments—I’ll participate in groups of at least 3;
> - logistics and plan changes communicated through the group chat;
> - access to my own transportation so I can leave independently at any time; and
> - no expectation that I explain or negotiate these boundaries during the weekend.
>
> Please let me know before **[date/time]** whether these arrangements can be maintained. If not, I’ll arrange separate accommodation or won’t attend.
